### Lab 2 – REST examples (VS Code "REST Client" extension or IntelliJ HTTP client)
@app = http://localhost:8082

### 1. Place an order (creates a process instance)
POST {{app}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORD-TC01",
  "customerRef": "CUST-1001",
  "customerCategory": "REGULAR",
  "productId": "P-200",
  "quantity": 2,
  "deliveryPreference": "EXPRESS",
  "paymentToken": "tok_test_visa_ok",
  "shippingPostcode": "560001"
}

# Response 201:
# {"processInstanceKey": 2251799813686307, "processDefinitionVersion": 1, "orderId": "ORD-TC01"}

### 2. Mock payment gateway – the call the REST Connector makes
POST {{app}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: ORD-TC01

{
  "orderId": "ORD-TC01",
  "customerRef": "CUST-1001",
  "amount": 209.37,
  "currency": "USD",
  "paymentToken": "tok_test_visa_ok"
}

# Response 200:
# {"paymentId":"PAY-B0538C3A","orderId":"ORD-TC01","amount":209.37,"currency":"USD","status":"APPROVED",
#  "declineReason":null,"processedAt":"2026-10-28T08:24:26.464+05:30"}

### 3. Declined payment
POST {{app}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: ORD-DEMO

{ "orderId": "ORD-DEMO", "customerRef": "CUST-1003", "amount": 31.99, "currency": "USD", "paymentToken": "tok_test_declined" }

# Response 200:
# {"paymentId":"PAY-496A6B7F","orderId":"ORD-DEMO","amount":31.99,"currency":"USD","status":"DECLINED",
#  "declineReason":"CARD_DECLINED","processedAt":"2026-10-28T08:28:37.275+05:30"}

### 4. Simulated inventory service – stock check (called by the lab2-check-inventory worker)
GET {{app}}/api/inventory/P-500?quantity=5

# Response 200:
# {"productId":"P-500","requested":5,"onHand":3,"available":false,"warehouse":"WH-SYNTH-01"}

### 5. Simulate outages / corrective action
PUT {{app}}/api/mock/payments/available/false
###
PUT {{app}}/api/mock/inventory/available/false
###
PUT {{app}}/api/mock/payments/available/true
###
PUT {{app}}/api/mock/inventory/available/true

### 6. Reset stock of a product (e.g. after many test runs)
PUT {{app}}/api/mock/inventory/stock/P-400/8
